  volume    =  25,
  number    =  7,
  pages     = "1618--1628",
  abstract  = "Natural systems contain more complexity than is accounted for in
               models of modern coexistence theory. Coexistence modelling often
               disregards variation arising from stochasticity in biological
               processes, heterogeneity among individuals and plasticity in
